  "prefLabel": "Env-Or 614.03 Disposal of Investigation and Remediation Wastes",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Or 614.03 Disposal of Investigation and Remediation Wastes. Except for PFAS determined to be hazardous waste pursuant to RSA 147-A, PFAS waste generated from the investigation or remediation of a site undertaken pursuant to this chapter may be disposed at a facility authorized to accept solid waste rather than a facility authorized to receive hazardous waste. This provision does not protect or immunize the disposing party from any liability to third parties that would otherwise attach or from any subsequent application of this chapter, Env-Or 600, Env-Hw 100 - 1400, or other applicable laws and rules to such disposal.\n\nSource. #14159, eff 12-25-24; ss by #14419, eff 11-4-25, EXPIRES: 11-4-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-or600.html"
